nt process for republication.\n42\t- Content outline:\n43\t  - VPAT: revised success-criterion-by-criterion conformance level and remarks for keyboard operability and focus visibility, scoped to the four audited flows and consistent with the strategy's out-of-scope boundaries (no screen-reader claims beyond what the keyboard fixes support).\n44\t  - Accessibility statement: updated description of keyboard support in the audited flows, remediation summary, and conformance reference.\n45\t\n46\t## Acceptance Criteria\n47\t\n48\t- The VPAT is updated to reflect the fixed keyboard conformance state of the four audited flows, with no conformance claim that the implemented fixes do not support.\n49\t- The product docs accessibility statement is updated to reflect the same state.\n50\t- The documentation is technically reviewed against the implemented keyboard accessibility fixes (reviewer confirms claims match actual behavior of the four flows).\n51\t- The updated VPAT and accessibility statement are submitted through the docs content process for republication.\n52\t\n53\t## HLR Traceability\n54\t\n55\t- **HLR-3 (P2)**: The accessibility conformance documentation (VPAT and product docs accessibility statement) is updated and republished to reflect the fixed state, with technical review.\n56\t\n57\t## Risks / Notes\n58\t\n59\t- Publication timing on the docs portal is controlled by the docs release process; the epic's completion point is reviewed, republication-ready content submitted through that process.\n60\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-8bd74f50285c7495","agent_id":"a81e9189fc6b5ff0d","session_id":"e9284ab1-017b-48c0-9b38-20475332623f","uuid":"6c71d611-4d5f-499e-bd88-7cfc4e0f40ca","timestamp":"2026-10-23T17:58:00.690Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-9c09ee744def36e4","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"claude","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9017 decomposition"}
